/0  254  1   _ _  _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _   HAT _
/1  254  1   Y _  _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _   BOX _
; PUT -> PUTIN 0 1 prints SM44, the container name, SM51. The
; markers show exactly which spaces the interpreter inserts.
; Table 3 loops with REDO so process 0 never runs out (jDAAD and
; the original ZX interpreter both end the game when it does).
/PRO 0
> _ _   CLS
        MESSAGE 0
        PROCESS 3
/PRO 1
> _ _   DONE
/PRO 2
> _ _   DONE
/PRO 3
> _ _   PARSE 0
        REDO
> _ _   PROCESS 4
        REDO
/PRO 4
> PUT _ PLACE 0 254
        PLACE 1 254
        PUTIN 0 1
        NEWLINE
        DONE
/END
